### Doctors Routes Tests
### Make sure your server is running on http://localhost:5000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/doctors

### Get all doctors
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Get doctor by ID (replace 1 with actual doctor ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### Get doctor by non-existent ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/999

### Get doctor by invalid ID (non-numeric)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invalid
